# The keys of the bindings; haptics.trace has the haptics they play. Space
# repeats while east is held (every 100 ms from 200 ms on, then the release
# at 600 lets go), and west taps F13 after the double-tap window, F14 for the
# double tap, and holds E.
+LCtrl@0 +Z@0
-Z@20 -LCtrl@20
+Space@100
+Space@200
+Space@300
+Space@400
+Space@500
+Space@600 -Space@600
+F13@940
-F13@960
+F14@1240
-F14@1260
+E@2250
-E@2400
+F15@2600
-F15@2620
+F16@2700
-F16@2720
